ole=\"presentation\"><span>30 day cooking policy</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Lifetime commissions for subscriptions purchases</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Auto-payouts via PayPal.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&bull; Other information:</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>We&rsquo;re a new, unique brand with a revolutionary product that is here to help people significantly reduce the amount of pain that they experience. Our product is completely drug and chemical-free, has no side effects, and is vegan-friendly.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
